I didn't change anything yet, because this service is a different case from `live-story.ts` and adding a record here would duplicate tokens that are already stored.

`context-recommendations.service.ts` makes no direct model call. It creates a real chat and runs the full agent through `agentService.create` + `agent.stream`, and the agent's own `onFinish` already persists usage onto the `chat_message` rows:

```520:534:apps/backend/src/services/agent.ts
